# This artifact is content-addressed: the implementation sources, fixture
# packs, and receipts are pinned by SHA-256, and the runtime self-checks those
# digests at load time. Treat every file as binary so git never rewrites line
# endings on checkout — a CRLF conversion (Git-for-Windows autocrlf default)
# would change the bytes and break the digest self-check on a fresh clone.
* -text
